    {
      "block_id": "code-31",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Mission: Phase 4A — OrchestratorLoop Shell Contract.\n\nAfter Phase 3, AgentLoop is a clean adapter shell delegating the while-loop to ConversationRuntime. Formalize this boundary.\n\n1. Create `AgentLoop` → `OrchestratorLoop` module-level alias in `rig_relay/core/agent_loop.py`.\n2. Formalize the `ConversationRuntimeCallbacks` protocol as THE only adapter interface.\n3. Add anti-regrowth AST guards: AgentLoop/Orchestrator must not contain `while True` or `while not should_break` loop patterns.\n4. Preserve all imports and backward compat.\n5. Add docs: `docs/audits/agent-loop/phase4a-shell-contract.md`.\n6. Tests: shell boundary guards, no-loop-regrowth, adapter protocol enforcement.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
